# Intentionally no static entries.
#
# This file once excluded the `{year}` placeholder URLs built from
# `workshop_list_url_pattern` in conferences.yml. That field was deleted in
# 8c9fec9 (the templated schedule pages are JS-rendered and yield no anchors), so
# the patterns had nothing left to exclude and were removed with it.
#
# It is not unused: the link-check workflow appends to it at run time from
# `scripts/lychee_exclusions.mjs`, one line per `review_ack.website` — URLs
# reviewed, declined, and kept in the data only so the importer cannot restore
# them. Those exclusions are generated from the corpus, never hand-listed here.
